{"id":"gd3xqaa6p0p3tvwizvx69ulkl","title":"观点：黄仁勋缺席后客户加速评估 AMD 与谷歌芯片","originalTitle":null,"summary":"某云厂商高管表示，因黄仁勋缺席，正加速评估 AMD 和谷歌芯片以降低对英伟达的依赖。该高管提到此前曾考虑多元化但担心冒犯黄仁勋未推进，现更担忧黄仁勋缺席影响英伟达未来几代芯片的质量与路线图。Jukan 分析称，阻止主要客户转向其他芯片厂商将成为临时 CEO Colette Kress 和继任者面临的关键挑战。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher"},"links":{"original":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2304774"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T13:46:15.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T14:01:28.672Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T14:01:28.672Z","category":"opinion","tags":["合作","半导体","NVIDIA","Google"],"score":55,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"b91d50bd-3e49-4330-9622-858cfd86ec5b","title":"英伟达客户因黄仁勋缺席加速评估AMD与谷歌芯片"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"b91d50bd-3e49-4330-9622-858cfd86ec5b","title":"英伟达客户因黄仁勋缺席加速评估AMD与谷歌芯片"}],"topics":[{"slug":"semiconductor","name":"半导体"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fUtJqFxgBP8Q","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}